      "writtenOn": "2025-08-07T14:10:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Everyone writing their own scripts doesn\u0027t seem like a good developer experience. If we\u0027re removing the integration from the RF-A Makefile (which is reasonable) then I really think we should be providing it somewhere else in a consistent way, like we agreed before.\n\nGetting started with RF-A should ideally be as simple as checking out a single repository (with submodules or similar for TF-A and RF-A itself) and running a single command (either a script or a make command or something equivalent), which should build everything necessary for the chosen platform and run the tests (at least for QEMU and FVP).",
